      <h1 class="tg-hero__title">Self-Defense as a Christian</h1>
      <p class="tg-hero__intro">
        If someone attacks me or my family, may I defend myself, and with what? What Scripture says
        about defending life, how to read Jesus' hard sayings, and the limits every follower of
        Christ should keep.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="tg-hero__key-verse">
        <p>If it is possible on your part, live at peace with everyone.</p>
        <cite><a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 12:18">Romans 12:18</a> (BSB)</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
